# Each nonblank line is location|estimated dollars|reported problem.
To work out the columns (list of text) of a record (text):
  Let the cells be an empty list of text.
  Let the cell be "".
  Let the cursor be 0.
  Repeat the length of the record times:
    Add 1 to the cursor.
    Let the glyph be (letter the cursor of the record) or else "".
    If the glyph is "|":
      Add the cell to the cells.
      Set the cell to "".
    Otherwise:
      Set the cell to "{the cell}{the glyph}".
  Add the cell to the cells.
  The answer is the cells.
